{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Indemon Tales",
    "steam_appid": 2426020,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426020/extras/57b80c8f2b0aaa3900b2563a832b3d9c.avif?t=1735775961\" /></span><br><br>Getting abducted by a group of monsters and forced to work for their demonic causes - sounds like a pretty terrible fate.<br>But once you realize that not all of them are monsters you need to fear, and that perhaps you even could become friends with each other, you get a unique opportunity to learn more about the history of Tarborea, the monsters' kingdom, and it's not-so-bright past.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426020/extras/45e94de04b39a6ec389507d728bf0eb0.avif?t=1735775961\" /></span><br><br>Inside the monster guild, you will meet fellows such as Gwen, the hard-working Kobold, Roviria, the self-proclaimed &quot;Fangster&quot; and Ikkri, the fearsome Demon that is the leader.<br><br>Become a seasoned miner, warrior, wizard or anything in-between and earn the respect of Ikkri's guild by completing tasks in dangerous dungeons until you get a chance to go back to the humans. Hopefully, nothing will get in your way, but the demon king might have something to say as well...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426020/extras/fcc14d24776dd5cf21c4df4865eac14b.poster.avif?t=1735775961\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426020/extras/fcc14d24776dd5cf21c4df4865eac14b.webp?t=1735775961\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426020/extras/57b80c8f2b0aaa3900b2563a832b3d9c.avif?t=1735775961\" /></span><br><br>Getting abducted by a group of monsters and forced to work for their demonic causes - sounds like a pretty terrible fate.<br>But once you realize that not all of them are monsters you need to fear, and that perhaps you even could become friends with each other, you get a unique opportunity to learn more about the history of Tarborea, the monsters' kingdom, and it's not-so-bright past.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426020/extras/45e94de04b39a6ec389507d728bf0eb0.avif?t=1735775961\" /></span><br><br>Inside the monster guild, you will meet fellows such as Gwen, the hard-working Kobold, Roviria, the self-proclaimed &quot;Fangster&quot; and Ikkri, the fearsome Demon that is the leader.<br><br>Become a seasoned miner, warrior, wizard or anything in-between and earn the respect of Ikkri's guild by completing tasks in dangerous dungeons until you get a chance to go back to the humans. Hopefully, nothing will get in your way, but the demon king might have something to say as well...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426020/extras/fcc14d24776dd5cf21c4df4865eac14b.poster.avif?t=1735775961\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426020/extras/fcc14d24776dd5cf21c4df4865eac14b.webp?t=1735775961\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>",
    "short_description": "Earn the respect of a guild full of monsters and demons as a lone human by taking part in dangerous dungeon adventures and uncover secrets behind the mysterious demon kingdom of Tarborea.",
